{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible, move to and grab it. Process it. If not, move randomly or perform a task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <SubTree ID = PerformRandomTask    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    />\"",
